    "detailed_description": "<u>Grow Up! - A Worm Game</u> is about a worm-like creature from space, trying to find their way in the vast world, can you guide them and help them... Grow Up?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Gameplay</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a truly unique form of character movement / control, requiring both mouse and keyboard.<br></li><li>The easy to learn, hard to master gameplay, will keep you <strong>coming</strong> back for more.<br></li><li>Several worlds, each filled with unique puzzles, gimmicks and challenges, your braincells will surely be stimulated!<br></li><li>Levels require light puzzle-solving, technical precision, and speed.<br></li><li>If you're fast, you could earn copper, silver or even gold medals!<br></li><li>With the high skill ceiling and a focus on speed, you can brag about your time achievements to other people!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<u>Grow Up! - A Worm Game</u> is about a worm-like creature from space, trying to find their way in the vast world, can you guide them and help them... Grow Up?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Gameplay</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a truly unique form of character movement / control, requiring both mouse and keyboard.<br></li><li>The easy to learn, hard to master gameplay, will keep you <strong>coming</strong> back for more.<br></li><li>Several worlds, each filled with unique puzzles, gimmicks and challenges, your braincells will surely be stimulated!<br></li><li>Levels require light puzzle-solving, technical precision, and speed.<br></li><li>If you're fast, you could earn copper, silver or even gold medals!<br></li><li>With the high skill ceiling and a focus on speed, you can brag about your time achievements to other people!</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Game of Worms, Growing, and Strenuous Arm Movement! Get your hands ready for this challenging, perhaps tear inducing, humorous 2D precision speed game!",
